33270::$$$message_0260_0135_0001$$$::I embrace her from behind.::
33271::$$$message_0260_0136_0000$$$::My pleasure and excitement rise to unseen heights, like the imperceptible flailing of a sword dance.[lr]::
33272::$$$message_0260_0136_0001$$$::I attack, Saber defends, and vice versa, so dizzyingly high and constant that it makes our earlier intercourse seem like child's play.::
33273::$$$message_0260_0137_0000$$$::"Saber...!"[lr]::
33274::$$$message_0260_0137_0001$$$::My groin is so hot I lose my sense of self.[lr]::
33275::$$$message_0260_0137_0002$$$::I could have come long ago,[lr]::
33276::$$$message_0260_0137_0003$$$::but I was drunk on our communion that lacks any physiological purpose.[lr]::
33277::$$$message_0260_0137_0004$$$::Her golden rain pours down on me, and I dance in its wetness.[lr]::
33278::$$$message_0260_0137_0005$$$::Our interconnected bodies share an inexhaustible rhythm...::
33279::$$$message_0260_0138_0000$$$::"I'm...ngh, [wait canskip=0 time=400]fwah, [wait canskip=0 time=100]ah, [wait canskip=0 time=100]Shiro[wait canskip=0 time=200]u...!"[lr]::
33280::$$$message_0260_0138_0001$$$::Saber's body convulses mightily.[lr]::
33281::$$$message_0260_0138_0002$$$::Her jerking, jolting tension is suddenly released.::
33282::$$$message_0260_0139_0000$$$::My semen rushes up from within.[lr]::
33283::$$$message_0260_0139_0001$$$::It comes out so profusely, so hotly that it hurts, reminding me of the first time I ever had sex.[lr]::
33284::$$$message_0260_0139_0002$$$::And so it was that I poured my pleasure into Saber, shattering my mind into a thousand pieces.::
33285::$$$message_0260_0140_0000$$$::"...Ah..."[lr]::
33286::$$$message_0260_0140_0001$$$::Did I moan, or was it Saber?[lr]::
33287::$$$message_0260_0140_0002$$$::An unbearable feeling of emptiness overcomes me, and I almost collapse in the bathroom.::
33288::$$$message_0260_0141_0000$$$::"...Whoa."[lr]::
33289::$$$message_0260_0141_0001$$$::Saber puts her palms on top of my hands as I brace myself against the wall.[lr]::
33290::$$$message_0260_0141_0002$$$::We lean against the wall, bodies pressing together.[lr]::
33291::$$$message_0260_0141_0003$$$::"...Shirou, let's wash ourselves off and warm up."[lr]::
33292::$$$message_0260_0141_0004$$$::Her whisper is so soft.::
33293::$$$message_0260_0142_0000$$$::"Hmm, mm, mm..."[lr]::
33294::$$$message_0260_0142_0001$$$::Saber hums a melody from a distant land.[lr]::
33295::$$$message_0260_0142_0002$$$::After briefing washing each other's bodies, we soak in the bathtub together again.::
33296::$$$message_0260_0143_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
33297::$$$message_0260_0143_0001$$$::Even though we were entangled just earlier, when I look at Saber's body now, it's like it all never happened.[lr]::
33298::$$$message_0260_0143_0002$$$::...Of course, it was no lie or illusion.::
33299::$$$message_0260_0144_0000$$$::"What's the matter, Shirou?"[lr]::
33300::$$$message_0260_0144_0001$$$::"Uh..."[lr]::
33301::$$$message_0260_0144_0002$$$::My mind isn't working very well.[lr]::
33302::$$$message_0260_0144_0003$$$::It's dulled by the hot water and the pleasure of everything we just did.::
33303::$$$message_0260_0145_0000$$$::Thinking about it doesn't help.[lr]::
33304::$$$message_0260_0145_0001$$$::Just bathing with Saber like this again is the most comforting relaxation there is...::
33305::$$$message_0260_0146_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
33306::$$$message_0260_0146_0001$$$::I gently move my hand in the water.[lr]::
33307::$$$message_0260_0146_0002$$$::What'll happen if I touch Saber again...?::
33308::$$$message_0260_0147_0000$$$::"Ah..."[lr]::
33309::$$$message_0260_0147_0001$$$::My hands flail in the hot water.[lr]::
33310::$$$message_0260_0147_0002$$$::Saber stands up, like a fish slipping through my hands.::
33311::$$$message_0260_0148_0000$$$::"...Oof."[lr]::
33312::$$$message_0260_0148_0001$$$::"Now, we should be getting out. If we stay in here much longer..."::
33313::$$$message_0260_0149_0000$$$::"Urgh.... Did I pass out in the bath?"[lr]::
33314::$$$message_0260_0149_0001$$$::"That's why [font italic=true]told[font italic=false] you to get out...[lr]::
33315::$$$message_0260_0149_0002$$$::You fainted, and that was completely preventable."::
33316::$$$message_0260_0150_0000$$$::I guess it's no wonder I started to feel sick, after doing [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] in a hot bath.[lr]::
33317::$$$message_0260_0150_0001$$$::On the other hand, Saber seems fine.[lr]::
33318::$$$message_0260_0150_0002$$$::Apparently, I failed to put on a dashing show at the very end.::
33319::$$$message_0260_0151_0000$$$::"...Sorry for making you worry."[lr]::
33320::$$$message_0260_0151_0001$$$::"Please don't be. That was a very good bath.[lr]::
33321::$$$message_0260_0151_0002$$$::We should take another one together sometime."[lr]::
33322::$$$message_0260_0151_0003$$$::You mean, um...[lr]::
33323::$$$message_0260_0151_0004$$$::...I should stop trying to think with a soft-boiled brain. Is it no fun being together?::
33324::$$$message_0260_0152_0000$$$::Saber smiles admonishingly at me, as if she knows what I'm thinking.[lr]::
33325::$$$message_0260_0152_0001$$$::"Next time, I hope you won't be as infatuated with me and the hot water."::
33326::$$$message_0260_0153_0000$$$::"Ergh..."[lr]::
33327::$$$message_0260_0153_0001$$$::Her playful smile takes my breath away.[lr]::
33328::$$$message_0260_0153_0002$$$::"...You're asking the impossible. I wish you'd praise me for not passing out right away."[lr]::
33329::$$$message_0260_0153_0003$$$::Her giggle echoes in the bathroom.[lr]::
33330::$$$message_0260_0153_0004$$$::Well, damn.[lr]::
33331::$$$message_0260_0153_0005$$$::It looks like Saber was the invincible heroine from start to finish today.:�\�